  "text": "And the number is not the same for every flight. A Monday morning business route may behave differently from a holiday flight. Airlines use demand forecasts, booking behavior, cancellations, and historical no-show patterns to decide how much overbooking — if any — a flight can tolerate. Some airlines don't oversell at all. The system is a forecast, not a rule.",
